# 1.20.1 descriptors (Yarn 1.20.1+build.1). Loom silently skips lines whose descriptor does not match,
# and on Forge only SE's own AW (converted to an AT) applies — so every line here must be exact.

# Custom render layer construction (CustomLayers): in the real 1.20.1 jar the 7-arg `RenderLayer.of` is
# private static and `RenderLayer$MultiPhase` is package-private (the decompiled tree is misleading).
# Same widening the legacy SpellEngine 1.20.1 branch and ArmorModelAPI use; no mixin alternative works
# (an @Invoker cannot name the MultiPhase return type, and a hand-rolled subclass breaks Iris bucketing).
accessible    class    net/minecraft/client/render/RenderLayer$MultiPhase
accessible    method    net/minecraft/client/render/RenderLayer    of    (Ljava/lang/String;Lnet/minecraft/client/render/VertexFormat;Lnet/minecraft/client/render/VertexFormat$DrawMode;IZZLnet/minecraft/client/render/RenderLayer$MultiPhaseParameters;)Lnet/minecraft/client/render/RenderLayer$MultiPhase;
# The 5-arg overload (item glow layers) is package-private too; on Fabric another mod's AW happens to widen it,
# on Forge only this file does.
accessible    method    net/minecraft/client/render/RenderLayer    of    (Ljava/lang/String;Lnet/minecraft/client/render/VertexFormat;Lnet/minecraft/client/render/VertexFormat$DrawMode;ILnet/minecraft/client/render/RenderLayer$MultiPhaseParameters;)Lnet/minecraft/client/render/RenderLayer$MultiPhase;
